flf2a$ 9 9 14 -1 4 0 0 0
Cosmeron ASCII -- fallback for legacy terminals and FIGlet renderers.
Same geometric designs as Cosmeron.flf using ASCII-only strokes.
Type COSMER0N (digit zero) for a power-button variant of the second O.
Full-width 12 columns, 9 rows; original work EUPL-1.2-or-later.
